WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:05.038
[electronic sound]

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.539
How's it going, bros?

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:07.573
This is PewDiePie.

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:08.641
You're about to
watch me

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:10.209
get the absolute
[bleep]

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:10.943
scared out of me

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:13.112
as I try to play
the most insane

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:14.580 align:start size:56% position:44% line:85%
[screaming]

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:14.580
live horror games ever.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.282
man on speaker:
<i> Aliens have taken over</i>

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:17.049
