00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.284
PewDiePie: Oh, those
are real!

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:19.285
Eww!

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:20.253
Why do I need
a helmet?

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.188
man:<i> There's a camera
 in the lantern.</i>

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:22.755
[growling,
screaming]

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:24.224
PewDiePie: Help me out!

00:00:24.857 --> 00:00:25.424
No tricks.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.826
- Promise?
- Promise.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.194
[screaming, banging]

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.529
I wanna go home now!

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.664
[Bleep] that's so
[bleep] hard.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:32.432
Okay.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:33.032
[Bleep]

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.834
Just a regular
Tuesday!

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.702
man on speaker:
<i> You have 3 minutes</i>

00:00:36.735 --> 00:00:38.237
<i> to cut this wire.</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.004
This isn't very fair.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.239
- Me, too.
- Don't let me die.

00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:41.574
[zapping]
[Bleep], [bleep]!

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:44.811
